#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A personal blog theme for Chinese and English writing: outlined cards in a two-column masonry, a one-line capsule header, one accent colour, automatic dark mode, reading time, and a year-by-year archive page. Zero JavaScript; English text uses a bundled 29 KB subset of Inter (SIL OFL 1.1)."
